   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## How to use - tested on RTX 3060 12 GB\n\n1. Load a photo in **Load Image**. MoGe reads its shape (pose, framing), you do not prepare a map.\n2. Describe the new picture in the prompt. The shape comes from your photo, everything else from the text.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\nIn the MoGe subgraph, **Render MoGe Geometry** is on *mask* (outline only). Set it to *depth* for a tighter pose. `end_percent` 0.6 lets the last steps render freely.\n\nLighter than the official template: MoGe 3 ViT-L (0.74 GB) instead of ViT-G (2.5 GB), and the w4a8 text encoder instead of int8.\n\nRTX 3060, 1 MP: 58 s."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
  {
   "id": 87,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -2530,
    40
   ],
   "size": [
    500,
    560
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 0,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Downloads",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads - put each file in the ComfyUI folder shown\n\nClick a file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| For | Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| all | `diffusion_models/` | [moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 5.41 GB |\n| all | `text_encoders/` | [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) | 7.34 GB |\n| all | `vae/` | [flux2-vae_small.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors) | 0.25 GB |\n| edit | `loras/` | [moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/loras/moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors) | 0.30 GB |\n| control | `loras/` | [moss_image_color_depth_control.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/loras/moss_image_color_depth_control.safetensors) | 0.31 GB |\n| control | `geometry_estimation/` | [moge_3_vitl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MoGe/resolve/main/geometry_estimation/moge_3_vitl_fp16.safetensors) | 0.74 GB |\n\nTotal: 14.3 GB. _Tested on: RTX 3060 12 GB · Ryzen 5 5600X · 32 GB RAM · ComfyUI 0.43.1 · sage attention._\n\nNeeds ComfyUI **0.43 or newer**, no custom nodes.\n\nLicense: MOSS-Image: Apache-2.0. Workflow: MIT."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
